---
import '../styles/global.css';
// Aquí irán los componentes después
---

<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Sense Vora | Nivara Ecosystem</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700&family=Playfair+Display:italic,wght@400;700&family=Fira+Code&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-[#050505] text-[#e0e0e0] font-sans selection:bg-cyan-500/30">

    <nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-[#050505]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/5 px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)]">
                <span class="text-black font-black">SV</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase">Sense <span class="text-cyan-400">Vora</span></h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <div class="hidden md:block text-right">
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Saldo Tinta</p>
                <p class="text-cyan-400 font-mono font-bold">💧 500.00</p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-cyan-500/50 p-0.5">
                <img src="https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/bottts-neutral/svg?seed=Angel" class="rounded-full bg-slate-800" alt="Avatar">
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 p-6">
        
        <aside class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-8">
            <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-xl">
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">ADN de Intereses</h3>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span>Poesía Digital</span><span class="text-cyan-400">85%</span></div>
                    <div class="w-full bg-white/5 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="bg-cyan-500 h-full w-[85%] shadow-[0_0_10px_#06b6d4]"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span>Riviera Maya</span><span class="text-blue-400">60%</span></div>
                    <div class="w-full bg-white/5 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="bg-blue-500 h-full w-[60%] shadow-[0_0_10px_#3b82f6]"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Vórtice (Agenda)</h3>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="border-l-2 border-purple-500 pl-4 py-1">
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">20:00 PM</p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold">Guerra de Escritores</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border-l-2 border-gray-800 pl-4 py-1">
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Mañana</p>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400">Cafelibro Meetup</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <section class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-8">
            <div class="bg-[#0f0f0f] border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-2xl">
                <textarea 
                    class="bg-transparent w-full text-xl font-serif italic outline-none resize-none placeholder:text-gray-700" 
                    placeholder="Vierte tu tinta aquí..." 
                    rows="4"></textarea>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <button class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/5 rounded-lg text-xs hover:bg-cyan-500/20 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Verso</button>
                        <button class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/5 rounded-lg text-xs hover:bg-cyan-500/20 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">Corrido</button>
                    </div>
                    <button class="bg-cyan-500 text-black px-8 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)]">
                        Publicar
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <div class="flex justify-between mb-6">
                        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400/60 tracking-widest tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Estrofa Seleccionada</span>
                        <span class="text-yellow-500">★ Maestro</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-2xl font-serif italic leading-relaxed text-gray-200">
                        "El código es el verso que el silicio no comprende, <br>
                        pero en la Riviera el alma, con neón siempre se enciende."
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-between items-center">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400">@Angel_Nivara</span>
                        </div>
                        <button class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-cyan-500/10 transition-colors">
                            <span class="text-cyan-400">💧</span>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase">Donar Tinta</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-8">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-950/20 to-black border border-cyan-500/20 rounded-3xl p-6 text-center">
                <div class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-4 relative">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-500 blur-2xl opacity-20 animate-pulse"></div>
                    <img src="https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=Bot" class="relative z-10" alt="IA">
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-2">Asistente Vora</h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"He analizado tus últimos versos. Tu ruta recomendada hoy es el Cafelibro 'El Alquimista' en Playa del Carmen."</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-6">
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Guerra en Vivo</h3>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                    <div class="flex-1 h-2 bg-red-500/20 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="bg-red-500 h-full w-[40%]"></div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold italic text-red-500">VS</span>
                    <div class="flex-1 h-2 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="bg-blue-500 h-full w-[60%]"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-center text-gray-600 uppercase">Votación con Tinta activa</p>
            </div>
        </aside>

    </main>

</body>
</html>